    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 53, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 A famous knight from Oren who served in the war to eradicate the monsters in the Forest of Mirrors. But his troops were defeated and he was eventually overcome by Oblivion's Mirror. Now he wanders the woods with no memory of the past, a dead man with a lost soul. Undead Lv. 1 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Undead. HP Recovery +10% Received P. Crit. Rate -5 Received Critical Damage -5% Received M. Crit. Damage -5% Vampiric Rage effect +1% Bow Skill Vampiric Rage effect +3% Resistance to Bleed +20% Resistance to Holy -10% Holy Vulnerability Lv. 2 Vulnerable to Divinity attack. Dark Attack Lv. 1 Unleashes a dark attack. Dagger/Rapier Resistance Lv. 3 Resistant to Dagger/Rapier attacks. Blunt Weapon Vulnerability Lv. 1 Vulnerable to Blunt Weapons. Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
